--partitions FILE                        required
--centers FILE                           required
--points-with-center-distance FILE       required
--roads FILE                             required
--roads-layer NAME
--output-dir PATH
--economy SPEC
--mwas-method VALUE
--json
```

This command is primarily a compatibility/restart boundary and intentionally requires explicit road input.

